          "summary": "Add RevMed IP-infringement and data-breach indemnity limbs to Section 14.1 and narrow Sanofi's indemnity under Section 14.2 to Sanofi-provided materials and Sanofi's breach of Applicable Law.",
          "comment": "[Playbook] RevMed's indemnity does not reach Third Party intellectual property claims and Section 13.5 disclaims any non-infringement warranty, so we have added an IP infringement/misappropriation limb and a limb for unauthorized access to or disclosure of Sanofi data, and conformed the Section 14.1 cross-reference. Consistent with our position that our own indemnity stays narrow, we have limited Section 14.2 to Sanofi-provided content and Sanofi's breach of Applicable Law.",
          "ops": [
            {
              "kind": "insert_after",
              "paragraphId": "p0584",
              "text": "(d) the infringement or misappropriation of any intellectual property right of a Third Party by the RevMed Licensed Technology or by Sanofi's exercise of the licenses granted to it under this Agreement; or (e) any unauthorized access to, or disclosure of, Sanofi's Confidential Information or other Sanofi data caused by RevMed;"
            },
            {
              "kind": "replace",
              "paragraphId": "p0585",
              "oldText": "((a) through (c))",
              "newText": "((a) through (e))"
